---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const updated = 'August 31, 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Service | ManhwaDaily"
  description="Terms of Service for ManhwaDaily, including content usage, affiliate disclosures, accounts, the AI Portrait purchase, and acceptable use."
  slug="terms"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="border-b border-brand-border/50 py-14">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <p class="text-brand-coral text-sm font-semibold mb-3">ManhwaDaily</p>
        <h1 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-brand-white mb-4">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="text-brand-dim leading-relaxed">
          Last updated: {updated}
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p>
          These Terms of Service (&quot;Terms&quot;) govern your access to and use of{' '}
          <strong>ManhwaDaily</strong> (the &quot;Service&quot;), accessible at{' '}
          <a href="https://manhwadaily.com">manhwadaily.com</a>, including our website, editorial
          content, recommendation quiz, free browser games (Gate Crawler, Gate Crawler World),
          accounts, and the paid AI Portrait feature.
        </p>

        <h2>Use of the Website</h2>
        <p>
          You may use ManhwaDaily for lawful, personal purposes only. You agree not to misuse
          the website or the game, interfere with its normal operation, attempt unauthorized
          access, scrape the site in a harmful way, or use the site to violate any applicable
          law, platform rule, or third-party right.
        </p>

        <h2>Editorial Content</h2>
        <p>
          ManhwaDaily publishes manhwa and light novel recommendations, rankings, and
          opinionated editorial content. We link out to where a series can be read — we do not
          host, copy, or republish manhwa or novel chapter content ourselves. We recommend
          reading on official, licensed platforms.
        </p>

        <h2>Accounts</h2>
        <p>
          Creating an account is optional. If you sign in, you're responsible for keeping your
          account credentials secure. Account sign-in is provided by our authentication
          provider, Clerk — creating an account also means you accept Clerk's own terms for the
          sign-in service itself.
        </p>

        <h2>Gate Crawler World — Leaderboard</h2>
        <p>
          If you sign in and play Gate Crawler World, your best score, class, and level may be
          displayed publicly on the in-game leaderboard alongside your account's display name.
          Do not use an offensive or impersonating display name. We may remove leaderboard
          entries at our discretion.
        </p>

        <h2>AI Portrait — Purchases</h2>
        <p>
          The AI Portrait feature lets you generate a stylized portrait from a photo you upload,
          for a one-time fee shown at checkout, paid via PayPal. You confirm you have the right
          to use the photo you upload. Because this is a digital good generated specifically for
          you, all sales are final once the paid file has been delivered, except where required
          otherwise by law.
        </p>

        <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          Some links on this website — including links to Amazon and to manhwa/novel reading
          platforms such as Webtoon, Tapas, and MangaDex — are affiliate links. If you click a
          qualifying link and make a purchase, ManhwaDaily may earn a commission at no additional
          cost to you. These relationships do not guarantee placement, endorsement, or ranking.
        </p>

        <h2>No Warranty</h2>
        <p>
          The website, the game, and all content are provided on an &quot;as is&quot; and
          &quot;as available&quot; basis. We do not guarantee that the site will always be
          uninterrupted, accurate, secure, complete, or free from errors.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services and Platforms</h2>
        <p>
          ManhwaDaily may link to or integrate with third-party services such as PayPal, Clerk,
          Giscus/GitHub, analytics providers, hosting services, affiliate platforms, and
          advertising networks. Your use of those services is governed by their own terms and
          privacy policies.
        </p>

        <h2>Comments</h2>
        <p>
          Article comments are powered by Giscus and posted as GitHub Discussions on our public
          site repository. Keep comments on-topic and respectful; we may hide or remove comments
          that are abusive, spam, or unlawful.
        </p>

        <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise stated, the branding, layout, written content, original graphics, and
          editorial assets on ManhwaDaily are owned by ManhwaDaily or used with permission. Cover
          art for reviewed titles is used for identification and review purposes. You may not
          reproduce, republish, distribute, or commercially exploit substantial portions of the
          site without prior written permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, ManhwaDaily and its operators will not be
          liable for indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or punitive damages arising
          from your use of the website, the game, or the AI Portrait feature.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to the Service</h2>
        <p>
          We may modify, suspend, update, or discontinue any part of the website, the game, or
          related features at any time without prior notice.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may revise these Terms of Service from time to time. The latest version will be
          posted on this page with the updated effective date. Continued use of the site after
          changes become effective means you accept the revised terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions regarding these terms, contact ManhwaDaily through the official website
          and public brand channels.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>
